      "id": "KS-01",
      "kind": "ksi_summary",
      "independent": "Assessor: not supplied by the provider",
      "confirmed": true,
      "ksi": "KSI-INR-RIR",
      "measures": "inr-rir-static checks that POL-INR covers the KSI, names an owner, sets a cycle of 365 days or less and that the plan has no TODO lines. inr-rir-live checks that the newest plan review is inside the cycle, was recorded by the CISO, and follows any report or review that required a plan change.",
      "cycle": "Each year, and when an after action report or a quarterly incident review finds that the plan needs to change (POL-INR INR-3).",
      "verification_measures": "The methods show that the owner reviewed the plan on time and after each required change. They do not show that the review judged the procedures effective (design gap).",
      "verification_automation": "Design status Verified: both methods were made to fail by recorded break tests (the live method on 2026-11-21). The validator build in this engagement repeated four break tests on 2026-11-22.",
      "validation": "Latest result pass, both methods pass. History: 3 not_implemented, 2 pass.",
      "sources": [
        {
          "input": "I-18",
          "location": "KSI-INR-RIR"
        },
        {
          "input": "I-01",
          "location": "INR-3"
        },
