          "location": "KSI-INR-RIR"
        },
        {
          "input": "I-20",
          "location": "KSI-INR-RIR"
        },
        {
          "frmr": "SDR-CSX-KSI"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "KS-02",
      "kind": "ksi_summary",
      "independent": "Assessor: not supplied by the provider",
      "confirmed": true,
      "ksi": "KSI-RPL-RRO",
      "measures": "rpl-rro-static checks that the RTO, RPO and review cycle are set and that POL-RPL covers the KSI. rpl-rro-live checks that the newest review of the objectives is inside the 90-day cycle and was recorded by the Platform Lead.",
      "cycle": "At least every 90 days (POL-RPL RPL-1).",
      "verification_measures": "The methods show that objectives exist and are reviewed on time by the owner. They do not show what the review concluded or that the objectives match the restore test results (design gap).",
      "verification_automation": "Design status Built: the live method failed in a recorded break test; the static method's break test has not been run (assessor review F-004).",
      "validation": "Latest result pass, both methods pass. History: 2 not_implemented, 3 pass.",
      "sources": [
