      "id": "KS-03",
      "kind": "ksi_summary",
      "independent": "Assessor: not supplied by the provider",
      "confirmed": true,
      "ksi": "KSI-CNA-RVP",
      "measures": "cna-rvp-static checks that POL-CNA requires an annual review and a review after each recorded change with a deadline by change type. cna-rvp-live checks the newest protection review's age, summary, reviewer and coverage of every protection resource. cna-rvp-change checks a review follows each change in the scope change log by its deadline.",
      "cycle": "At least once a year, and after each change in the scope change log by a deadline that depends on the change type (POL-CNA CNA-7a, CNA-7b).",
      "verification_measures": "The methods show dated reviews by the right person, covering every protection resource and following every recorded change. They do not show that a review judged the protections effective, and changes missing from the scope change log cannot trigger a review (design gap).",
      "verification_automation": "Design status Built: unit tests and a manual break test of the change method on 2026-11-22.",
